Package: snclient
Version: UNSET
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: UNSET
Pre-Depends: init-system-helpers (>= 1.54~)
Depends: logrotate, adduser
Suggests: monitoring-plugins-basic
Maintainer: Sven Nierlein <sven@consol.de>
Homepage: https://github.com/Consol-Monitoring/snclient/
Bugs: https://github.com/Consol-Monitoring/snclient/issues
Description: Monitoring agent designed to replace NRPE and NSClient++.
 SNClient is a cross-platform monitoring agent. It provides NRPE/NSCP-style
 system checks and Prometheus metrics.
 .
 Protocols:
  * NRPE: v2/v4
  * nscp rest api: legacy / v1
